:1.1": "“Cirassaṁ vata passāma, ", "ja509:1.2": "brāhmaṇaṁ devavaṇṇinaṁ; ", "ja509:1.3": "Mahājaṭaṁ khāridharaṁ, ", "ja509:1.4": "paṅkadantaṁ rajassiraṁ. ", "ja509:2.1": "Cirassaṁ vata passāma, ", "ja509:2.2": "isiṁ dhammaguṇe rataṁ; ", "ja509:2.3": "Kāsāyavatthavasanaṁ, ", "ja509:2.4": "vākacīraṁ paṭicchadaṁ. ", "ja509:3.1": "Āsanaṁ udakaṁ pajjaṁ, ", "ja509:3.2": "paṭigaṇhātu no bhavaṁ; ", "ja509:3.3": "Agghe bhavantaṁ pucchāma, ", "ja509:3.4": "agghaṁ kurutu no bhavaṁ”. ", "ja509:4.1": "“Adhicca vede pariyesa vittaṁ, ", "ja509:4.2": "Putte gahe tāta patiṭṭhapetvā; ", "ja509:4.3": "Gandhe rase paccanubhuyya sabbaṁ, ", "ja509:4.4": "Araññaṁ sādhu muni so pasattho”. ", "ja509:5.1": "“Vedā na saccā na ca vittalābho, ", "ja509:5.2": "Na puttalābhena jaraṁ vihanti; ", "ja509:5.3": "Gandhe rase muccanamāhu santo, ", "ja509:5.4": "Sakammunā hoti phalūpapatti”. ", "ja509:6.1": "“Addhā hi saccaṁ vacanaṁ tavetaṁ, ", "ja509:6.2": "Sakammunā hoti phalūpapatti; ", "ja509:6.3": "Jiṇṇā ca mātāpitaro tavīme, ", "ja509:6.4": "Passeyyuṁ taṁ vassasataṁ arogaṁ”. ", "ja509:7.1": "“Yassassa sakkhī maraṇena rāja, ", "ja509:7.2": "Jarāya mettī naravīraseṭṭha; ", "ja509:7.3": "Yo cāpi jaññā na marissaṁ kadāci, ", "ja509:7.4": "Passeyyuṁ taṁ vassasataṁ arogaṁ. ", "ja509:8.1": "Yathāpi nāvaṁ puriso dakamhi, ", "ja509:8.2": "Ereti ce naṁ upaneti tīraṁ; ", "ja509:8.3": "Evampi byādhī satataṁ jarā ca, ", "ja509:8.4": "Upaneti maccaṁ vasamantakassa”. ", "ja509:9.1": "“Paṅko ca kāmā palipo ca kāmā, ", "ja509:9.2": "Manoharā duttarā maccudheyyā; ", "ja509:9.3": "Etasmiṁ paṅke palipe byasannā, ", "ja509:9.4": "Hīnattarūpā na taranti pāraṁ. ", "ja509:10.1": "Ayaṁ pure luddamakāsi kammaṁ, ", "ja509:10.2": "Svāyaṁ gahīto na hi mokkhito me; ", "ja509:10.3": "Orundhiyā naṁ parirakkhissāmi, ", "ja509:10.4": "Māyaṁ puna luddamakāsi kammaṁ”. ", "ja509:11.1": "“Gavaṁva naṭṭhaṁ puriso yathā vane, ", "ja509:11.2": "Anvesatī rāja apassamāno; ", "ja509:11.3": "Evaṁ naṭṭho esukārī mamattho, ", "ja509:11.4": "Sohaṁ kathaṁ na gaveseyyaṁ rāja. ", "ja509:12.1": "Hiyyoti hiyyati poso, ", "ja509:12.2": "Pareti parihāyati; ", "ja509:12.3": "Anāgataṁ netamatthīti ñatvā, ", "ja509:12.4": "Uppannachandaṁ ko panudeyya dhīro”. ", "ja509:13.1": "“Passāmi vohaṁ daharaṁ kumāriṁ, ", "ja509:13.2": "Mattūpamaṁ ketakapupphanettaṁ; ", "ja509:13.3": "Abhuttabhoge paṭhame vayasmiṁ, ", "ja509:13.4": "Ādāya maccu vajate kumāriṁ. ", "ja509:14.1": "Yuvā sujāto sumukho sudassano, ", "ja509:14.2": "Sāmo kusumbhaparikiṇṇamassu; ", "ja509:14.3": "Hitvāna kāme paṭikacca gehaṁ, ", "ja509:14.4": "Anujāna maṁ pabbajissāmi deva”. ", "ja509:15.1": "“Sākhāhi rukkho labhate samaññaṁ, ", "ja509:15.2": "Pahīnasākhaṁ pana khāṇumāhu; ", "ja509:15.3": "Pahīnaputtassa mamajja bhoti, ", "ja509:15.4": "Vāseṭṭhi bhikkhācariyāya kālo”. ", "ja509:16.1": "“Aghasmi koñcāva yathā himaccaye, ", "ja509:16.2": "Katāni jālāni padāliya haṁsā; ", "ja509:16.3": "Gacchanti puttā ca patī ca mayhaṁ, ", "ja509:16.4": "Sāhaṁ kathaṁ nānuvaje pajānaṁ”. ", "ja509:17.1": "“Ete bhutvā vamitvā ca, ", "ja509:17.2": "pakkamanti vihaṅgamā; ", "ja509:17.3": "Ye ca bhutvāna vamiṁsu, ", "ja509:17.4": "te me hatthattamāgatā. ", "ja509:18.1": "Avamī brāhmaṇo kāme, ", "ja509:18.2": "so tvaṁ paccāvamissasi; ", "ja509:18.3": "Vantādo puriso rāja, ", "ja509:18.4": "na so hoti pasaṁsiyo”. ", "ja509:19.1": "“Paṅke ca posaṁ palipe byasannaṁ, ", "ja509:19.2": "Balī yathā dubbalamuddhareyya; ", "ja509:19.3": "Evampi maṁ tvaṁ udatāri bhoti, ", "ja509:19.4": "Pañcāli gāthāhi subhāsitāhi”. ", "ja509:20.1": "Idaṁ vatvā mahārājā, ", "ja509:20.2": "esukārī disampati; ", "ja509:20.3": "Raṭṭhaṁ hitvāna pabbaji, ", "ja509:20.4": "nāgo chetvāva bandhanaṁ. ", "ja509:21.1": "“Rājā ca pabbajjamarocayittha, ", "ja509:21.2": "Raṭṭhaṁ pahāya naravīraseṭṭho; ", "ja509:21.3": "Tuvampi no hohi yatheva rājā, ", "ja509:21.4": "Amhehi guttā anusāsa rajjaṁ”. ", "ja509:22.1": "“Rājā ca pabbajjamarocayittha, ", "ja509:22.2": "Raṭṭhaṁ pahāya naravīraseṭṭho; ", "ja509:22.3": "Ahampi ekā carissāmi loke, ", "ja509:22.4": "Hitvāna kāmāni manoramāni. ", "ja509:23.1": "Rājā ca pabbajjamarocayittha, ", "ja509:23.2": "Raṭṭhaṁ pahāya naravīraseṭṭho; ", "ja509:23.3": "Ahampi ekā carissāmi loke, ", "ja509:23.4": "Hitvāna kāmāni yathodhikāni. ", "ja509:24.1": "Accenti kālā tarayanti rattiyo, ", "ja509:24.2": "Vayoguṇā anupubbaṁ jahanti; ", "ja509:24.3": "Ahampi ekā carissāmi loke, ", "ja509:24.4": "Hitvāna kāmāni manoramāni. ", "ja509:25.1": "Accenti kālā tarayanti rattiyo, ", "ja509:25.2": "Vayoguṇā anupubbaṁ jahanti; ", "ja509:25.3": "Ahampi ekā carissāmi loke, ", "ja509:25.4": "Hitvāna kāmāni yathodhikāni. ", "ja509:26.1": "Accenti kālā tarayanti rattiyo, ", "ja509:26.2": "Vayoguṇā anupubbaṁ jahanti; ", "ja509:26.3": "Ahampi ekā carissāmi loke, ", "ja509:26.4": "Sītibhūtā sabbamaticca saṅgan”ti. ", "ja509:27.1": "Hatthipālajātakaṁ terasamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja509:0.1": "", "ja509:0.2": "", "ja509:0.3": "", "ja509:0.4": "", "ja509:1.1": "", "ja509:1.2": "", "ja509:1.3": "khāridharaṁ → bhāradharaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja509:1.4": "", "ja509:2.1": "", "ja509:2.2": "", "ja509:2.3": "", "ja509:2.4": "", "ja509:3.1": "", "ja509:3.2": "", "ja509:3.3": "", "ja509:3.4": "", "ja509:4.1": "", "ja509:4.2": "gahe → gehe (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja509:4.3": "paccanubhuyya → paccanubhotva (sya1ed, sya2ed); paccanubhutva (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja509:4.4": "so → te (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja509:5.1": "", "ja509:5.2": "", "ja509:5.3": "muccanamāhu → muñcanamāhu (bj, mr) ", "ja509:5.4": "Sakammunā → sakammanā (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja509:6.1": "", "ja509:6.2": "", "ja509:6.3": "tavīme → tavayime (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja509:6.4": "arogaṁ → arogyaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja509:7.1": "", "ja509:7.2": "", "ja509:7.3": "", "ja509:7.4": "", "ja509:8.1": "", "ja509:8.2": "", "ja509:8.3": "", "ja509:8.4": "maccaṁ → maccu (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja509:9.1": "", "ja509:9.2": "", "ja509:9.3": "byasannā → visannā (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja509:9.4": "", "ja509: